README - Phenix Europe LLC Information Page 🚀
Overview 📝
This project creates a clean and professional information page for Phenix Europe LLC.
The design is minimalist, black and white, and focuses on presenting company data clearly and efficiently.

Features ✨
Single-page layout (no navigation)

Responsive design (mobile & desktop)

Minimalist, business-inspired styling

Clearly organized sections: header, company details, legal notes, footer

Technologies Used 💻
HTML5 (structure)

CSS3 (styling: flexbox, grid, media queries)

No JavaScript – pure CSS

No additional dependencies (no frameworks or libraries)

Structure 🏗️
Header: Company name & tagline

Info Section: Grid layout with official information: company name, agent, addresses, organizer, contact, date

Description: Legal/general mention about the company's status

Footer: Copyright and rights reserved

Development Steps 🛠️
Design Brief: Defined business requirements for a sober, modern page

Component Building: Used semantic HTML for accessibility and clear sections

Styling: Applied your preferred minimalist CSS, ensured responsive layouts

Content Entry: Inserted data from official documents

Testing: Verified appearance on all devices, iterated for best results

How to Use 🚦
Just open index.html in any web browser!
No setup, install, or server required.

Customization 🎨
For updates: Edit the text in the .info-value spans

To add fields: Duplicate .info-item blocks

For style changes: Adjust the CSS <style> section

License 📄
Feel free to use or modify for corporate websites or documentation.

